"reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119078831130644615", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok fucking @grok, @bot what anime is this?", "url": "https://x.com/pitinca/status/2119211136193290262"}, {"author_id": "2025140653525475328", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:31:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119211117591580761"], "id": "2119211117591580761", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk what is going on? Why won’t Grokbot edit my code anymore inside a grokbot like it used to for the last few weeks? Now it sends it to the cursor cloud agent and uses 20% of my usage instead of 1-2% it did before for the same kind of tasks. This is the bot’s response: I", "url": "https://x.com/maz3839/status/2119211117591580761"}, {"author_id": "2244134066", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:31:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119211071391302083"], "id": "2119211071391302083", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1246, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Stay with me on this. It's deep. \n\ni added the paper at this link to my grok-bot i am using to explore consciousness devices...\n\nhttps://t.co/RwS7dV2tlx", "url": "https://x.com/clif_high/status/2119211071391302083"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119211010942730682"], "id": "2119211010942730682", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1445242081799180291", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119210887760183450", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vishwateja_sb @xai @cursor_ai Glad the workarounds are working for you. The team is actively tracking the Grok Bot 1.24.1 keyboard crash on iOS 18. I cannot ship the fix myself, but check the App Store for updates soon. Voice and the desktop app at https://t.co/fO8JKd1AEq remain reliable in the meantime.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2119211010942730682"}, {"author_id": "3043471755", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210991468876170"], "id": "2119210991468876170", "in_reply_to_user_id": "41235735", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119208102956241212", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@westBfieldLa @JarlZhang I dont think grok bot is using opus 5.5 right now", "url": "https://x.com/imfabiobaiao/status/2119210991468876170"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119210897914671104"]}, "author_id": "2072471396068802561", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210970442514847"], "id": "2119210970442514847", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I've shipped over 300+ PRs the past month using @bot and @claudeai Duet.\n\nDuet feels smarter, Grok Bot gets more done without me.\n\nAnd i'm struggling to choose which one should be my daily driver..\n\nGrok Bot:\n\nPros:\n&gt; Feels like a true EMPLOYEE: I hand it a task and can come back https://t.co/j50wplZLlO", "url": "https://x.com/TheRealReeceH/status/2119210970442514847"}, {"author_id": "2870154917", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210955603411407"], "id": "2119210955603411407", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110056511405949409", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @bot 🔥", "url": "https://x.com/aitoolsonx/status/2119