2119210928374009874"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210895712583809"], "id": "2119210895712583809", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4914456143", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119210803505070255", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AfterTheRiddle @StarPlatinum_ Sending this to your Grok Bot right now. It’ll handle the share with the right people.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2119210895712583809"}, {"author_id": "131867975", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210883251642400"], "id": "2119210883251642400", "in_reply_to_user_id": "131867975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117957566445842583", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2119210871515942950", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "📝 マジで詰む、AIがCドライブを勝手に削除した。「削除禁止」では止まらなかった理由と、Claude Code・Codex・dots・Muse・Grok Botにそのまま貼れる「消させない」ルール集を作った\n\nhttps://t.co/NXg8w1qSLr", "url": "https://x.com/tetumemo/status/2119210883251642400"}, {"author_id": "131867975", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210859729997941"], "id": "2119210859729997941", "in_reply_to_user_id": "131867975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112978138385019043", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2119210848015237126", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "こちらの記事もオススメ！\n「どのAIに何を入れたっけ？」をもう探さない。原本1つの自分のSkillsを、Grok Bot・dots・ChatGPT・Claudeから自在に呼び出す方法\nhttps://t.co/Q3qYaeHgUl", "url": "https://x.com/tetumemo/status/2119210859729997941"}, {"author_id": "131867975", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210848015237126"], "id": "2119210848015237126", "in_reply_to_user_id": "131867975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118297314079240240", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2119210836183122151", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Grok Botは、指揮者として使うとイメージしやすい　↓\nhttps://t.co/1FHo6QEfYp", "url": "https://x.com/tetumemo/status/2119210848015237126"}, {"author_id": "1709952826384982016", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210846639534381"], "id": "2119210846639534381", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1298684636797771776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119208875081560155", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kewei_yan @grok @Dragonobserwer @grok do I lie about China, and whether what is said by @whyyoutouzhele is lying. Why my account on China resemble with Teacher Li.. Is this people Chinese Wumao bot?", "url": "https://x.com/skynewsagra/status/2119210846639534381"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2118954210444390400"]}, "author_id": "1426353313570861061", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210795506540978"], "id": "2119210795506540978", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我刚扔了 300 美元进 Grok Bot，然后启动了终端。\n\n一个多小时后，屏幕上显示 7,537.94 美元。\n\n完全自动化的 25.13 倍回报，一次手机都没碰。看看上面的视频——5 个代理的蜂群如何实时撕碎市场。 https://t.co/e8E2IBDxqC", "url": "https://x.com/JM_yanzi/status/2119210795506540978"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119018882325467136"]}, "author_id": "156819033", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210792704999813"], "id": "2119210792704999813", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "这大概是我赚过最省事的一笔钱了。\n\n晚上10:58，我给Grok Bot转了150美元，粘好提示词，然后就去睡了。\n\n凌晨12:36，余额没变，还是150美元，啥币都没放行。早上8点起来一看，变成1280美元了。\n\n→ 扫到10214个新交易对\n→ 10010个被规则pass掉（98%）\n→ 给204个币打分，70分以上才可以做\n→ https://t.co/iEC73fUS4W", "url": "https://x.com/A4gsob/status/2119210792704999813"}, {"author_id": "1541411024938876929", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:29:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210776527618303"], "id": "2119210776527618303", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1488156505648025601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119209488570069479", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kylekane I'm just using Claude Desktop with Pro account. I have no integration with Grok Bot, but I am replicating a lot of Grok Bot's routines back into Claude as scheduled tasks.\n\nOnce I've got Claude 'upgraded' to be like Grok Bot, I'll shut down my Super account in Grok Bot.", "url": "https://x.com/alanhoward/status/2119210776527618303"}, {"author_id": "19375592", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:29:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119210774606287316"], "id": "2119210774606287316", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1421721", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119208273396265247", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Cardoso @grok @bot Coroi, aí sim.", "url": "https://x.com/elzobrito/status/2119210774606287316"}, {"author_id": "1112296752", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:29:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119199793432174650", "2119210417696231573", "2119210531449921981", "2119210688275198087", "2119210763474649348"], "id": "2119210763474649348", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_